<section class="chapter"><h2>Livraria Cultura</h2><p>From October 2000 to January 2001, Nicchio had an approximately three-month <em>summer job</em> at <strong>Livraria Cultura</strong> in Shopping Villa-Lobos, selling technical books. The passage remains in the Full Biography as a chronological curiosity outside the main professional axes.</p><div class="inline-records"><a class="inline-record" href="/assets/archive/livraria-cultura-card-2000.webp" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><img src="/assets/archive/livraria-cultura-card-2000.webp" loading="lazy" decoding="async" alt="Livraria Cultura professional card with the name Marcelo Henrique Nicchio." width="995" height="612"><span><strong>Livraria Cultura · professional card</strong><small>Open record ↗</small></span></a></div></section>
